comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T22:52:48.600Z",codex-agent,"Asset tests verify all path-only mark/lockup variants, five PNG dimensions, and every pixel outside the maskable safe circle. Removing the back sheet from the single geometry function makes asset assertions fail; restoring the function regenerates the exact original outputs."
  "2026-10-16T23:00:54.778Z",codex-agent,"Final visual correction: monochrome rear outlines now use occlusion masks derived from the same sheet geometry, so they do not cross the top sheet. A dedicated pixel test checks occlusion and inherited currentColor. Reverting only the mark function to Milestone 1 and rebuilding assets makes that assertion fail. All originals restored."
  "2026-10-16T23:10:13.646Z",codex-agent,"Clean-checkout correction: the generator now imports tracked src/font-data.ts instead of reading an untracked font-build cache. The asset gate creates a fresh directory with only tracked generator/data inputs and verifies all 16 outputs byte-for-byte. The previous generator fails this gate with missing-cache evidence; the corrected generator passes."
  "2026-10-16T23:34:43.914Z",codex-sol,"Round 1: add currentColor ink, transparent caption outlines, embedded dark-scheme styles, fixed light/dark variants, and mark-caption lockups; verify renders and contrast for both themes."
  "2026-10-16T23:38:11.890Z",codex-sol,"Render tests passed for all 26 fixed SVGs plus monochrome in both themes: ink against paper is 14.127:1 light and 15.076:1 dark; top-sheet contrast is 15.429:1 light and 13.561:1 dark. Adaptive CSS structure and resolved fixed geometry agree; caption interiors are transparent. Six asset tests pass. Clean generator gate verifies 47 outputs."
  "2026-10-16T23:39:34.144Z",codex-sol,Visual review found pre-existing wordmark clipping and overlap at the caption edge. Increased the wordmark canvas and caption gap; render assertions now require a transparent separator and right margin in both themes. Review PNGs will include every mark and both six-product lockup families on the pr-screenshots branch.
